+ *
+ * BC1-BC5 -> ETC2/EAC transcoder for the BC lowmem path (csf-v11/197).
+ *
+ * One invocation per 4x4 block. The BC block is decoded exactly (same
+ * arithmetic as panvk_bc_s3tc.comp / panvk_bc_rgtc.comp) and re-encoded:
+ *
+ *   BC1 RGB         -> ETC2 RGB8     (diff/individual, H and planar modes)
+ *   BC1 RGBA        -> ETC2 RGB8A1   (punch-through for blocks with alpha)
+ *   BC2, BC3        -> ETC2 RGBA8    (EAC alpha + ETC2 colour)
+ *   BC4 UNORM/SNORM -> EAC R11 (signed)
+ *   BC5 UNORM/SNORM -> EAC RG11 (signed)
+ *
+ * The output goes straight into the U-interleaved shadow plane: 4x4-block
+ * tiles, blocks inside a tile in the u-interleaved order of pan_tiling.c.
+ *
+ * The encoder is written in the GLSL subset that is also valid C (I()/U()/F()
+ * casts, CARR tables, no out parameters) so it can be unit tested on the
+ * host by including this file with PANVK_BC_C_TEST defined (skip line 1).
+ */
